3. **The other venue prints within seconds.** After a Kalshi trade in the Premier League, Polymarket prints within 5 s in {{ k.wait.pl_k[5] }} of cases and within 60 s in {{ k.wait.pl_k[60] }}. The reverse direction is faster; the World Cup is near-instant.

